{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/extras/67445d00513abb28e50fddd6b4e982ab.avif?t=1760779566\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/extras_big/67445d00513abb28e50fddd6b4e982ab.avif?t=1760779566 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of growing an army of sunflowers while your grumpy grandpa complains in the corner? In <i><strong>Sunfinity</strong></i>, that\u2019s exactly what awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Start small:</strong></u> a handful of seeds, a patch of dirt, and your own hands to plant and harvest. Sell your first sunflowers for a few coins, reinvest them in more seeds, tractors, employees... and before you know it, you won\u2019t be touching a single flower yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Your farm evolves before your eyes:</strong></u> machines take over, tractors harvest for you, and your stats skyrocket. Each upgrade makes your farm more profitable, faster, and more efficient. Meanwhile, Grandpa George \u2014 your lazy, retired grandpa who never misses a chance for a sarcastic comment \u2014 follows you with grumpy but oddly endearing advice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/extras/e9e557ae16eff6ce5738bc8437841d48.avif?t=1760779566\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/extras_big/e9e557ae16eff6ce5738bc8437841d48.avif?t=1760779566 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>But not everything grows under sunshine and smiles:</strong></u> insects can wipe out your crops, viruses can infect your plants\u2026 Luckily, luck comes back around. A rare card at the market, a wad of cash dug up in the garden, or a winning lottery ticket can change everything \u2014 if you\u2019re paying attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its random events, infinite upgrades, and secrets scattered throughout, <i>Sunfinity</i> is a game that never really ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Your goal:</strong></u> automate everything, optimize everything, and maybe \u2014 just maybe \u2014 make Grandpa George a little proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cYou do know which end of the shovel to hold, right? Or should I print you a tutorial?\u201d</i> <strong>\u2013 Grandpa George</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870850?t=1760779566","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870850?t=1760779566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/d3fc26e721677471fdfd866efa9baded1f2cacf4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760779566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/d3fc26e721677471fdfd866efa9baded1f2cacf4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760779566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/extras/67445d00513abb28e50fddd6b4e982ab.avif?t=1760779566\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/extras_big/67445d00513abb28e50fddd6b4e982ab.avif?t=1760779566 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of growing an army of sunflowers while your grumpy grandpa complains in the corner? In <i><strong>Sunfinity</strong></i>, that\u2019s exactly what awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Start small:</strong></u> a handful of seeds, a patch of dirt, and your own hands to plant and harvest. Sell your first sunflowers for a few coins, reinvest them in more seeds, tractors, employees... and before you know it, you won\u2019t be touching a single flower yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Your farm evolves before your eyes:</strong></u> machines take over, tractors harvest for you, and your stats skyrocket. Each upgrade makes your farm more profitable, faster, and more efficient. Meanwhile, Grandpa George \u2014 your lazy, retired grandpa who never misses a chance for a sarcastic comment \u2014 follows you with grumpy but oddly endearing advice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/extras/e9e557ae16eff6ce5738bc8437841d48.avif?t=1760779566\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/extras_big/e9e557ae16eff6ce5738bc8437841d48.avif?t=1760779566 width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>But not everything grows under sunshine and smiles:</strong></u> insects can wipe out your crops, viruses can infect your plants\u2026 Luckily, luck comes back around. A rare card at the market, a wad of cash dug up in the garden, or a winning lottery ticket can change everything \u2014 if you\u2019re paying attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its random events, infinite upgrades, and secrets scattered throughout, <i>Sunfinity</i> is a game that never really ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Your goal:</strong></u> automate everything, optimize everything, and maybe \u2014 just maybe \u2014 make Grandpa George a little proud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cYou do know which end of the shovel to hold, right? Or should I print you a tutorial?\u201d</i> <strong>\u2013 Grandpa George</strong></p>","developers":["Varakers"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870850/f6fd6af2c041ea146d45cd367b07b59b01903dd5/header.jpg?t=1760779566","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3870850/107736214/7b54ffc529b56ea32060eb7a00a54a076830aac1/1758627840/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758628516","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3870850/107736214/7b54ffc529b56ea32060eb7a00a54a076830aac1/1758627840/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758628516","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3870850/107736214/7b54ffc529b56ea32060eb7a00a54a076830aac1/1758627840/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758628516","id":257204628,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204628/movie480.mp4?t=1758628516","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204628/movie_max.mp4?t=1758628516"},"name":"First Look","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204628/27880fd09860fc21e21f1b2a85c1fa41b9151859/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758628516","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204628/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758628516","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204628/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758628516"}}],"name":"Sunfinity","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Sunfinity - $3.99 USD","packageid":1360683,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","pric